#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/34_through_the_bura/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I have counted the Baron's planks. Every one is fresh oak!"
msgstr "Я пересчитал доски барона. Все до одной — свежий дуб!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/34_through_the_bura/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the meeting in Rijeka is soon!"
msgstr "{crew|Капитан|Капитан|Капитаны}, скоро встреча в Риеке!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/34_through_the_bura/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the witnesses: Juraj, Brother Ambroz on Krk and Master Ivan in Bakar."
